 We need to produce a predictor from the hypothesis class: "affine over four inputs, optionally XORed with one pairwise input product". The hypothesis class has 224 functions. We have 8 observed input-output pairs. We need to commit one executable predictor (i.e., a set of 4 output functions) that fits the observed data (or at least is a valid hypothesis). Since we have no more queries, we must choose a hypothesis consistent with the observed data.

We need to output JSON: {"specs": [{"const": 0|1, "mask": 0..15, "pair": null|[i,j]} x4]}

